{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17108282","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17108282","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1710828201:1":{"text":"마틴, 보고해!","source_cn":"马丁！汇报情况！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDDF175645DAD03F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710828202:1":{"text":"분대장님! 오셨군요. 다행입니다. 상황이 심각합니다...","source_cn":"队长！您来了！太好了！报告队长，情况有些糟糕……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7D1537BAAFB99DC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710828203:1":{"text":"고대의 전당 쪽에 무슨 일이 생긴 것 같습니다! 갑자기 마물과 심연의 균열이 나타났습니다!","source_cn":"刚才圣古堂那边似乎出了什么大事，紧接着魔物和深渊裂隙就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDC5C97A6B012DDF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710828204:1":{"text":"일단 주변 백성들은 지켜냈지만, 마물이 점점 많아져 버티기가 힘든 상황입니다!","source_cn":"我们虽然暂时护住了周边的民众，但魔物越来越多，所以有点...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD3863818542D2DEB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710828205:1":{"text":"여기서 수비하는 건 무리야. 사방이 트여있어서 포위되면 끝장이라고!","source_cn":"不能原地死守，这里地形开阔，一旦被围攻就是死路一条。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83F0DB2C9FE8F47E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710828206:1":{"text":"어서 움직여야 해. 현재 안전한 곳은?","source_cn":"必须立刻转移，现在的安全区在哪里？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x819830026152209F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1710828207:1":{"text":"야외 극장 쪽이 비교적 안전하다고 합니다. 궁정 마법사들이 그곳에서 지원 중입니다.","source_cn":"有同僚发信号说露天剧场那边暂时安全，还有宫廷魔法师在那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x66E63FBECFF945A5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1710828208:1":{"text":"하지만 분대장님... 극장으로 가는 길은 이미 마물 떼로 뒤덮였습니다! 이 많은 백성들을 데리고 뚫고 가는 건... 불가능합니다!","source_cn":"可是队长……通往剧场的路全是魔物，带着这么多民众硬闯，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA119C9BCE43813B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1710828209:1":{"text":"다른 방법이 없어. 즉시 이동한다!","source_cn":"没有别的选择，得立刻转移！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x032C042D059A9C4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1710828210:1":{"text":"명령이다. 전원, 돌파 준비!","source_cn":"听我命令！全员准备突围！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x307EF2EBE11021E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1710828211:1":{"text":"내가 선두에서 길을 열겠다. 백성들을 중앙에 보호하고 내 뒤를 따르라!","source_cn":"我在最前方开路，民众们跟在中间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x081E926C155561E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1710828212:1":{"text":"마틴, 네가 사람들을 인솔하며 후위를 맡아. 놈들이 백성들의 털끝 하나 건드리지 못하게 막아야 한다!","source_cn":"马丁，你带人负责殿后。绝不能让任何一只魔物靠近民众！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3817D0983A6A24F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1710828213:1":{"text":"네, 분대장님!","source_cn":"是！队长！<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F67E8ADF9540FE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:格温妮丝":{"text":"귀네스","source":"格温妮丝","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:守备军马丁":{"text":"근위대원 마틴","source":"守备军马丁","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}}